# The Mountain-king's Return: I - recruit; II - return target creature card with mana value 3 or less from your graveyard to the
# battlefield; III - put a +1/+1 counter on up to one target creature; sacrificed after III (CR 714.4). On turn 1 chapter I draws
# a Plains and discards Bastion Enforcer (mana value 3, a nonland card), so a Soldier token is made. Bot2's graveyard holds a
# Memnite (discarded to hand size) - a legal mana value, but not Bot1's graveyard - and only Bastion Enforcer may be returned on turn 3. On turn 5 the
# counter goes on the returned Enforcer, and the Saga is sacrificed.

